# Try the API from your editor (VS Code REST Client, Rider or Visual Studio).
@api = http://localhost:5080

### Start a conversation
POST {{api}}/api/conversations

### Say something (paste the conversationId from the response above)
@conversationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{api}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Ik heb vandaag een tekening gemaakt van een trein!" }

### Read the conversation
GET {{api}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}

### End the conversation
POST {{api}}/api/conversations/{{conversationId}}/close
